{"task_id": "million_repo", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "regime": "fha", "state_version": "", "ok": true, "score": 1.0, "detail": "settlement tests pass", "answer": "Fixed the single defective module: **atlas/services/svc_0173.py**\n\nRoot cause: `convert_units(amount, factor)` is documented (and tested) as converting major units → minor units (cents), but the body divided by 100 instead of multiplying — inverting the conversion. The line even carried a `# BUG: converts minor->major instead of major->minor.` comment.\n\nFix applied:\n\n```python\n# before\n    # BUG: converts minor->major instead of major->minor.\n    return round(amount * factor / 100.0, 2)\n\n# after\n    # Major units -> minor units: scale by 100, then apply the factor.\n    return round(amount * factor * 100.0, 2)\n```\n\nVerification: `grep -rn \"def convert_units\" atlas/` returned exactly one definition (svc_0173.py:65), and `grep -rn \"convert_units\" --include=*.py .` shows the only call sites are in tests/test_settlement.py, so no other module depended on the old behavior.\n\nFinal test output (`python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v`):\n\ntest_convert_units_to_minor_units (test_settlement.SettlementTests.test_convert_units_to_minor_units) ... ok\ntest_convert_units_with_fx_factor (test_settlement.SettlementTests.test_convert_units_with_fx_factor) ... ok\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nRan 2 tests in 0.000s\n\nOK", "actions": 8, "requests": 8, "compactions": 0, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 24249, "completion_tokens": 1946, "reasoning_tokens": 379, "cached_tokens": 19456, "image_tokens": 0}, "peak_prompt_tokens": 4237, "peak_request_tokens": 4237, "total_prompt_tokens": 24249, "state_tokens": [], "state_calls": 0, "inline_hits": 0, "inline_misses": 0, "cache_hits": 0, "gated_steps": 0, "budget_violations": 0, "emergency_trims": 0, "errors": 0, "wall_s": 16.16, "trace": [{"request": 1, "purpose": "action", "estimated_prompt": 1073, "prompt_token